node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store

# Heavy regen inputs/outputs, fetched/generated on demand (see fetch-references.sh).
# LiquidBounce source + decompiled MC (cloned/symlinked by fetch-references.sh).
# Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored `references/` also matched
# `typings/types/net/minecraft/references/`, so `git add` silently dropped NEW
# .d.ts there (e.g. BlockItemId/BlockItemIds) while the registry still referenced
# them — a dangling-import drift that shipped in past releases.
/references/
# Raw ts-generator output before it's promoted into typings/:
tools/regen-output/
# Persistent per-class render cache (ModuleCache): prior run's raw .d.ts + manifest:
tools/regen/.module-cache/
# CI regen Gradle/Minecraft download cache (mounted into the container):
gradle-cache/
# Headless JDK+MC harness (large; provided separately):
tools/script-runner/
# Downloaded Kotlin compiler toolchain (kdoc-extractor):
**/kotlinc/
# Python venvs / caches:
**/.venv*/
**/__pycache__/
